🗂️ Your 15-Project Mastery Roadmap → Leading to SAHAY


🟢Phase - 1

Project 1 — 📄 OCR Document Scanner
What: Upload any image (medical bill, ID card, handwritten notes) → extract clean text
Tech: Tesseract OCR + OpenCV + Streamlit
SAHAY Connection: How SAHAY reads medical reports & documents
Time: 3–4 days

Project 2 — 🌐 Multilingual Text Translator & Simplifier
What: Take complex English text → simplify it → translate to Telugu/Hindi/Tamil
Tech: IndicTrans2 or Google Translate API + NLTK for simplification
SAHAY Connection: How SAHAY explains things in local languages
Time: 3–4 days

Project 3 — 😊 Sentiment Analysis on Real Reviews
What: Analyze patient reviews, product reviews, or tweets → positive/negative/neutral
Tech: BERT fine-tuned + HuggingFace Transformers + Gradio
SAHAY Connection: Understanding user emotions & feedback in SAHAY
Time: 4–5 days

Project 4 — 🔍 Text Classification Engine
What: Given any paragraph, classify it — is it medical? legal? financial? general?
Tech: DistilBERT + scikit-learn + FastAPI
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY routes queries to the right module (medical vs legal vs govt)
Time: 4–5 days

Project 5 — 🎤 Speech-to-Text in Indian Languages
What: Record voice in Telugu/Hindi → convert to text → display output
Tech: OpenAI Whisper + PyAudio + Streamlit
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's voice input feature for non-literate users
Time: 4–5 days






🟡 PHASE 2 — Intermediate Intelligence (Projects 6–10)

Project 6 — 📋 Medical Report Explainer (Mini SAHAY!)
What: Upload a blood test PDF → AI explains each value in simple English
Tech: PyMuPDF (PDF parsing) + GPT/Claude API + Streamlit
SAHAY Connection: The #1 core feature of SAHAY
Time: 5–6 days

Project 7 — 🔗 RAG — Personal Knowledge Chatbot
What: Upload any PDF (textbook, govt scheme doc) → chat with it intelligently
Tech: LangChain + FAISS vector DB + OpenAI embeddings + Streamlit
SAHAY Connection: How SAHAY searches legal & government documents smartly
Time: 6–7 days

Project 8 — ⚖️ Legal Document Simplifier
What: Paste any legal clause (rent agreement, employment contract) → get plain English explanation
Tech: LLM (Claude/GPT) + RAG on Indian legal corpus + FastAPI
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's legal rights explainer module
Time: 5–6 days

Project 9 — 💊 Drug Interaction Checker
What: Enter 2–3 medicine names → AI warns if they're dangerous together
Tech: Named Entity Recognition (NER) + Drug interaction dataset + BioBERT
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's medicine safety checker
Time: 6–7 days

Project 10 — 🏛️ Government Scheme Eligibility Finder
What: Enter your details (income, state, gender, age) → get schemes you qualify for
Tech: RAG + PM India scheme database + LLM + Gradio
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's government scheme finder module
Time: 6–7 days






🔴 PHASE 3 — Advanced & Production-Level (Projects 11–15)

Project 11 — 🧠 Multimodal AI — Image + Text Understanding
What: Upload a photo of a medicine strip → AI reads the name, dosage, expiry, and explains usage
Tech: GPT-4 Vision / LLaVA + OCR + FastAPI
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's medicine photo reader for elderly users
Time: 7–8 days

Project 12 — 🤖 AI Agent with Tool Use
What: Build an agent that autonomously searches the web, reads documents & answers complex health/legal questions
Tech: LangChain Agents + Tool calling + SerpAPI + Claude/GPT
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's backend intelligence engine
Time: 8–10 days

Project 13 — 🗣️ Voice Chatbot in Telugu/Hindi
What: Speak in Telugu → AI understands → replies in Telugu voice
Tech: Whisper (STT) + LLM + gTTS or Coqui TTS (Text-to-Speech)
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's full voice mode for rural/illiterate users
Time: 7–8 days

Project 14 — 📊 Fine-Tuning a Model on Medical Data
What: Fine-tune a small LLM (like Mistral 7B or Llama 3) on Indian medical Q&A data
Tech: HuggingFace PEFT + LoRA fine-tuning + Google Colab / Kaggle GPU
SAHAY Connection: SAHAY's private, offline-capable AI brain
Time: 10–12 days

Project 15 — 🔐 End-to-End Secure AI Pipeline
What: Build a system where user data is processed privately, locally, never stored in cloud
Tech: Ollama (local LLMs) + LangChain + Docker + FastAPI
SAHAY Connection: Making SAHAY safe, private & trustworthy for sensitive health data
Time: 8–10 days





